    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 💬 Cách Sử Dụng\nNhập thông tin sách vào chat. Ví dụ:\n\n\"Tạo content pack cho sách **Đắc Nhân Tâm** của Dale Carnegie. Thể loại: self-help. Target: dân văn phòng 25-35 tuổi. Core promise: biết cách gây thiện cảm và thuyết phục bất kỳ ai. Tone: gần gũi. Mục tiêu: bán sách. Giá: 89.000đ\"\n\nAI sẽ tự động:\n1. Load skills từ GitHub\n2. Tạo 5 Hooks\n3. Viết Script 60s\n4. Viết Caption + 2 bộ Hashtag\n5. Viết Blurb (Short/Medium/Long)\n6. Top 10 Keywords SEO\n7. 5 CTA variations",
        "height": 400,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "8644a190-5100-498c-a6fe-c568fcdfbdbf",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -800,
        128
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ Skills Repos\nFlow kéo skills SONG SONG từ 2 repos:\n\n📦 **Public** (Anthropic):\n`anthropics/skills`\n\n🔒 **Private** (Repo của bạn):\n`Duyquangit666888kk/n8n-content-creator-skills`\n\n**5 Skills đang dùng:**\n- `tiktok/hook-generator`\n- `tiktok/caption-writer`\n- `tiktok/hashtag-researcher`\n- `books/blurb-writer`\n- `seo/keyword-analyzer`\n\nĐể thêm repo → update node\n**Set GitHub Repo URLs**",
        "height": 448,
        "width": 256,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "0d336067-ac6d-40af-9efc-f0cedeb506ef",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -464,
        32
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤖 Content Creator Agent\n\n**Input:** Thông tin sách từ chat\n\n**Process:**\n1. Load skill directory map từ GitHub\n2. Fetch 5 SKILL.md ĐỒNG THỜI (concurrent)\n3. Follow instructions trong từng skill\n\n**Output — Full Content Pack:**\n- 📌 5 Hook options\n- 🎬 Script TikTok 60 giây\n- 📝 Caption + 2 bộ Hashtag\n- 📚 Blurb (Short/Medium/Long)\n- 🔑 Top 10 Keywords SEO\n- 📣 5 CTA variations\n\n**Temperature: 0.7** | **maxIterations: 150**",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 384,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "fd78f8bd-be42-4247-ae01-36a70809a422",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        704,
        176
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🛠️ Agent Tools\n\n**List Files by Path Name**\n→ Agent khám phá cấu trúc skills repo\n\n**Get a File From GitHub**\n→ HTTP Request lấy plain text (không phải GitHub node\n  vì GitHub node trả base64 — tốn token)\n→ Configured với Header Auth cho private repo\n\n**⚙️ Cần setup credential:**\n- Type: Header Auth\n- Name field: `Authorization`\n- Value: `token YOUR_GITHUB_PAT`",
        "height": 464,
        "width": 464,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c10244fc-86fd-409a-a0d0-2956d7c23b13",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1088,
        512
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "List the files and directories inside of dirs.\nUse this tool on any DIR to see the files and other directories inside of it",
        "resource": "file",
        "operation": "list",
        "owner": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $fromAI('repoUsername') }}"
        },
        "repository": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $fromAI('repoName') }}"
        },
        "filePath": "={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('Path', \"`/` would be root, `/folder` would list files in the folder named folder\", 'string') }}"
      },
      "id": "dead271b-ab72-4f43-97a4-5c175102e793",
      "name": "List Files by Path Name",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.githubTool",
      "position": [
        1152,
        816
      ],
      "webhookId": "b309da8c-2f65-4c37-bb15-7c8a88c482ba",
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "Fetch the raw text content of a skill file from GitHub. Use this to read the contents of a SKILL.md file. Provide the full raw URL of the file.",
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('url', 'The full GitHub raw content URL of the skill file to fetch. Format: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{owner}/{repo}/main/{path}', 'string') }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "ed2563ed-88fa-4fe9-b56a-d448223f5971",
      "name": "Get a File From GitHub",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequestTool",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "github-token-auth",
          "name": "GitHub Token Auth"
        }
      },
      "position": [
        1392,
        832
      ],
      "typeVersion": 4.4
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fetch & Prepare Skills for Agent\nThis:\n1. Gets the directory from the GitHub Repository\n2. Removes duplicates & irrelevant files to save context\n3. Gets nested `/skills` directory if it exists\n4. Merge all data together to prepare for use in the Agent node's system prompt\n",
        "height": 528,
        "width": 736,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "fc7a6405-8e99-47d0-89ce-b25e474098bd",
      "name": "Sticky Note6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -128,
        32
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "43fca12e-d89e-442c-9cf0-32873aef6ccd",
      "name": "Merge Directory Structures",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "position": [
